  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Elections Integrity Activity (EIA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID/serbia seeks to support a local organization or a coalition of local organizations to conduct election observation of national and local elections and promote meaningful electoral reform. The activity will explore innovative ways to achieve meaningful electoral reform.</narrative>
  </description>
